@startuml
title ZoneTalk - Sequence Diagram

autonumber
actor User
participant "ZoneTalk UI (React)" as UI
participant "Browser Storage\n(localStorage/sessionStorage)" as Store
participant "Zone Engine" as Zone
participant "Browser Media APIs" as Media

User -> UI : Open app
UI -> Store : Load cached conversations/messages
UI --> User : Show Chats view

User -> UI : Switch to Zone tab
UI -> Zone : Generate nearby people (coffee/ride)
Zone --> UI : Return people list + positions
UI --> User : Show radar or car seat map

User -> UI : Select nearest person
UI -> Store : Load/create direct thread
UI --> User : Open nearest-person chat

User -> UI : Click "Message everyone here"
UI -> Store : Load/create broadcast thread
UI --> User : Open zone broadcast conversation

User -> UI : Type message + Send
UI -> Store : Persist message with timestamp
UI --> User : Render message bubble

UI -> UI : Start auto-reply timer
UI -> Store : Persist simulated reply
UI --> User : Show new reply

User -> UI : Open emoji picker
UI --> User : Emoji list shown

User -> UI : Toggle voice note recording
UI -> Media : Request microphone permission
alt Permission granted
  Media --> UI : Audio stream
  UI -> Store : Save audio message
  UI --> User : Show voice note bubble
else Permission denied
  Media --> UI : Permission denied error
  UI --> User : Show microphone warning
end

@enduml
